your app will fit well.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:28.400
Your app fits well with
the tools in the ecosystem.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.732
You fit well with Kubernetes.

00:01:30.732 --> 00:01:31.940
You fit well with serverless.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:36.730
